Upstream sources and their terms
--------------------------------

This dataset is a compilation derived from third-party sources. Their terms
continue to apply to the portions of the data that originate with them; the
CC BY 4.0 license above covers this compilation. When redistributing, please
preserve attribution to all of the following:

* arXiv paper metadata (titles, authors, categories, submission dates),
  obtained via the Kaggle "arXiv Dataset" snapshot.
    License: CC0 1.0 (public domain dedication).
    https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/Cornell-University/arxiv

* Citation counts, from Semantic Scholar (the Semantic Scholar Academic Graph).
    License: ODC-BY 1.0 (Open Data Commons Attribution) — attribution required.
    https://www.semanticscholar.org/product/api/license
    "Citation counts courtesy of Semantic Scholar."

* Social attention scores, from Hacker News via the Algolia HN Search API.
    Public, factual data (story points). Attribution to Hacker News /
    Y Combinator.
    https://hn.algolia.com/api

THE DATA IS PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. Citation counts and
attention scores are point-in-time snapshots and may be incomplete or stale.
